Domain email URL-pool repair verification
Date: 2026-08-31
Baseline commit: 0f0b4582e800fe327e9c1862b124b6979b27be39

Baseline input:
  Registration source=cloudflare_domain
  EMAIL_DOMAIN is blank
  Domain pool contains imported email----code_url rows
  Literal failure: QQMailClientError: EMAIL_DOMAIN not configured

Modified behavior:
  cloudflare_domain atomically claims an imported email + code_url row.
  OTP reads the row URL through the same HTML and dynamic /data parser as iCloud.
  EMAIL_DOMAIN and QQ IMAP settings are no longer part of the active registration path.
  Registration/rebind counts exclude legacy rows without a code URL.
  Account rows expose the same URL-copy action for iCloud and domain email accounts.

